A '''Xeric's aid (+)''' is a potion that restores the player's [[Hitpoints]] and [[Defence]], while draining the player's [[Strength]], [[Attack]], [[Magic]], and [[Ranged]]. It can be made with 78 [[Herblore]], giving 26 experience, by using a [[buchu leaf]] with a [[water-filled gourd vial]] while having [[endarkened juice]] in the inventory. Making this potion gives 26.5 herblore experience.

A Xeric's aid (+) temporarily raises Hitpoints by 15% + 5 and Defence by 20% + 5, both rounded down. It temporarily lowers [[Strength]], [[Attack]], [[Magic]] and [[Ranged]] by 10% + 4. It can heal above the player's maximum Hitpoints level.

This potion is the strongest variant of Xeric's aid, and cannot be taken out of the [[Chambers of Xeric]].

